From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cam <cam@x.invalid>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 12:37:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] i2c: qcom-cci: initialize every master completion

The m15-safe DTB enables CCI1 master 1 without master 0. Probe still
resets using master 0, whose completion is not initialized when its
child node is unavailable. Calling reinit_completion() on a zeroed
completion is invalid because its wait queue has not been initialized.

Initialize all master completions immediately after allocation, before
requesting the IRQ or resetting the controller.

Signed-off-by: cam <cam@x.invalid>
---
 drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-qcom-cci.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-qcom-cci.c b/drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-qcom-cci.c
--- a/drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-qcom-cci.c
+++ b/drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-qcom-cci.c
@@ -514,6 +514,9 @@
 	if (!cci)
 		return -ENOMEM;
 
+	for (i = 0; i < NUM_MASTERS; i++)
+		init_completion(&cci->master[i].irq_complete);
+
 	cci->dev = dev;
 	platform_set_drvdata(pdev, cci);
 	cci->data = device_get_match_data(dev);
@@ -559,7 +562,5 @@
 				master->mode = I2C_MODE_FAST_PLUS;
 		}
-
-		init_completion(&master->irq_complete);
 	}
 
 	/* Memory */
-- 
2.47.3
